# WEBRTC CAN realtime transmission

Real-time streaming and bidirectional communication of Controller Area Network (CAN) bus telemetry over WebRTC DataChannels.

## Example Code

```python
import asyncio
import json
import can
from aiortc import RTCPeerConnection, RTCDataChannel

bus = can.interface.Bus(channel='vcan0', bustype='socketcan')

async def stream_can(channel: RTCDataChannel):
    reader = can.AsyncBufferedReader()
    notifier = can.Notifier(bus, [reader], loop=asyncio.get_event_loop())
    while True:
        msg = await reader.get_message()
        if channel.readyState == 'open':
            channel.send(json.dumps({'id': hex(msg.arbitration_id), 'data': list(msg.data)}))
```

